{"ref":"BDB, זמר","hw":"זמר","html":"† I. <big><big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">זמר</span>]</big></big>  <strong>vb.</strong> only <strong>Pi.</strong> make music in praise of God <span dir=\"rtl\">(י׳)</span>, only poet. <strong>(</strong>Arabic <span dir=\"rtl\">زَمَرَ</span> <em>pipe, play</em> on a reed; Aramaic <span dir=\"rtl\">ܙܡܰܪ</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">זַמֵּר</span> and deriv.; Ethiopic ዘመረ in der. conjj.; on an orig. meaning <em>hum, murmur</em>, cf. Hup<sup>ZKM iii, (1840) 394 ff. iv, 139 ff.</sup> <em>Id</em><sup>Psalm. Einl. § 7, 2</sup> De<sup>4</sup> on <a data-ref=\"Psalms 3\" href=\"/Psalms.3\">ψ 3</a><strong>)</strong>—<br><strong>Pi.</strong>  Impf. 3 ms. sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">יְזַמֶּרְךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 30:13\" href=\"/Psalms.30.13\">ψ 30:13</a>; 1 s. <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲזַמֵּר</span> <a data-ref=\"Judges 5:3\" href=\"/Judges.5.3\">Ju 5:3</a> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 22:50\" href=\"/II_Samuel.22.50\">2 S 22:50</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">(וַ)אֲזַמְּרָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 7:18\" href=\"/Psalms.7.18\">ψ 7:18</a> + 7 times;, <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲזַמֵּ֑רָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 18:50\" href=\"/Psalms.18.50\">ψ 18:50</a> + 3 times; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲזַמֶּרְךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 57:10\" href=\"/Psalms.57.10\">ψ 57:10</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 108:4\" href=\"/Psalms.108.4\">108:4</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲזַמְּרֶ֑ךָּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 131:1\" href=\"/Psalms.131.1\">ψ 131:1</a>; 3 mpl. <span dir=\"rtl\">יְזַמְּרוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 66:4\" href=\"/Psalms.66.4\">ψ 66:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 149:3\" href=\"/Psalms.149.3\">149:3</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">וִיזַמְּרוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 66:4\" href=\"/Psalms.66.4\">ψ 66:4</a>; 1 pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">נְזַמְּרָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 21:14\" href=\"/Psalms.21.14\">ψ 21:14</a>; Imv. mpl. <span dir=\"rtl\">זַמְּרוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 9:12\" href=\"/Psalms.9.12\">ψ 9:12</a> + 14 times, <span dir=\"rtl\">זַמֵּ֑רוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 4