alms 108:2\" href=\"/Psalms.108.2\">108:2</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">אשׁירה</span>; instrumental accomp. v <a data-ref=\"Psalms 47:3\" href=\"/Psalms.47.3\">3</a>; cf. also v <a data-ref=\"Psalms 47:4\" href=\"/Psalms.47.4\">4</a> supr.), <a data-ref=\"Psalms 47:7\" href=\"/Psalms.47.7\">47:7</a><sup>(×2)</sup>. <strong>2.</strong>  of playing musical instruments <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּנֵבֶל עָשׂוֹר זַמְּרוּ־לוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 33:2\" href=\"/Psalms.33.2\">ψ 33:2</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">הודו לי׳ בְּכִנּוֹר</span>), cf. <a data-ref=\"Psalms 144:9\" href=\"/Psalms.144.9\">144:9</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">אשׁירה</span>); <span dir=\"rtl\">אזמרה לך בכנור</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 71:22\" href=\"/Psalms.71.22\">71:22</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">אודך בִכְלִי־נֶבֶל</span>); <span dir=\"rtl\">ז׳ לי׳ בכנ֑ור בכנור וקול זמרה</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 98:5\" href=\"/Psalms.98.5\">98:5</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">ז׳ לא׳ בכנור</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 147:7\" href=\"/Psalms.147.7\">147:7</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">ענו לי׳ בתודה</span>); <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּתֹף וכנור יזמרו־לו</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 149:3\" href=\"/Psalms.149.3\">149:3</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">יהללו שׁמו בְּמָחוֹל</span>).","next":"BDB, זִמְרָה","prev":"BDB, זְמָ֑ן"}